ai-memory doctor --posture enterprise-federation
  (v1.0.0 3x7 cutline ruling §5.3 — docs/audit/3x7-v1-cutline-ruling-2026-08-01.md)

  [FAIL] AI_MEMORY_SECURITY_PROFILE
